      "value": "SELECT u.name, COUNT(o.id) as order_count\nFROM users u\nLEFT JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.user_id\nWHERE u.created_at > '2024-01-01'\nGROUP BY u.name\nHAVING COUNT(o.id) > 5\nORDER BY order_count DESC;",
